11. The total_amount in the orders table is suspected to be incorrect for some orders. Write a query to calculate the actual total for every order by joining orders, order_items, and products, multiplying price * quantity, and grouping by order_id. 

select o.order_id, sum(p.price * oi.quantity) as actual_total 
from orders o 
join order_items oi 
on o.order_id = oi.order_id
join products p 
on oi.product_id = p.product_id 
group by o.order_id ;

